<title>UK: SBC sets call and put warrants on the MIB30 index.</title>
<headline>SBC sets call and put warrants on the MIB30 index.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Swiss Bank Corp has issued 10 million American-style call and put warrants, in two equal tranches, on the MIB 30 index, lead manager SBC Warburg said.</p>
<p>One warrant controls one index.</p>
<p> WARRANTS   STRIKE	ISS PRICE	 PREMIUM	 GEARING</p>
<p> CALL	 20,000.0    1,700.00 ITL    14.20 PCT     11.7 TIMES</p>
<p> PUT	  20,000.0    2.010.00 ITL     5.60 PCT     9.45 TIMES</p>
<p> MATURITY DATE   31.MAR.98		 PAYDATE	17.FEB.97</p>
<p> LISTING	   LUXEMBURG		 MIN EXER LOT 100</p>
<p> SPOT REFERENCE  19,000.00 ITL</p>
<p>--Reuter London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
